# Class: <http://w3id.org/toso/vocab/TOSO_0000005> (Reproductive quality)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://w3id.org/toso/vocab/TOSO_0000005> "An organismal quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's ability to produce new life or offspring.")
