# Class: <http://w3id.org/toso/vocab/TOSO_0000006> (Sexual system)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://w3id.org/toso/vocab/TOSO_0000006> "Morphological pattern of sex allocation or distribution of male and female function across individuals in a species.")
